      "side": 1,
      "message": "The build generally can\u0027t write to the tree.  Even if we enabled writes when the env variable was set, I don\u0027t think it would be a good experience, a global flag would modify files all of the tree, leaving a huge mess to clean up in your git projects.  I think an external script that used the zip file output or gerrit suggested changes would provide better experiences.",
