      "writtenOn": "2022-08-15T16:08:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Nit: could we add another environment variable similar to `ANDROID_LINT_CHECK` (maybe `ANDROID_LINT_FIX\u003dtrue` or `ANDROID_LINT_APPLY_SUGGESTIONS\u003dtrue` to enable this, and have it disabled by default?\n\nSince it will make changes to the user\u0027s working tree, that would keep things consistent with the way other tools work.  e.g. java/kotlin formatters that run in git hooks and then prompt the user to run manually to apply suggestions.",
      "revId": "34dec6214f0f9cb9dd18b54456d1abd2fae37314",
